# OpenEdge ABL: Progress OpenEdge ABL Reference (12.x); requirements/languages/abl.md
name     abl openedge progress
keyword  DEFINE VARIABLE AS INITIAL NO-UNDO FOR EACH WHERE NO-LOCK EXCLUSIVE-LOCK FIND FIRST LAST IF THEN
keyword  ELSE DO END REPEAT LEAVE NEXT RETURN PROCEDURE FUNCTION RETURNS RUN DISPLAY MESSAGE ASSIGN CREATE
keyword  DELETE TRANSACTION CLASS METHOD PUBLIC PRIVATE INPUT OUTPUT PARAMETER AND OR NOT
type     CHARACTER INTEGER DECIMAL LOGICAL DATE DATETIME INT64 HANDLE
builtin  TRUE FALSE YES NO TODAY NOW
fold-case
ident-part     -
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
escape        : char=~
operators  +-*/=<>:.
